          "en": "“It’s just been a casual kick - just a fewlaughs, that's all.” “Try on the coat,” said I.\n\nHe complicd. The coat bunched high over his cars and dropped all the way down to his shoe tops. He looked like a mound of dead raccoons. “Fits fine.” he said happily.\n\nI rosc from my chair. “Is it a deal?” | asked. extending my hand.\n\nHe swallowed. “It's a deal,” he said and shook my hand.\n\nI had my first date with Polly the following evening. This was in the nature of a survey; I wanted to find out just how much work | had to do to get her mind up to the standard I required.\n\n1 took her first to dinner. “Gee, that was a delish dinner,” she said as we left the restaurant. Then 1 took her to a movie. “Gee, that was a marvy movie,” she said as we left the theater. And then 1 took her home.\n\n“Gee. | had a sensaysh time.” she said as she bade me good night.\n\nI went back to my room with a heavy heart. | had gravely underestimated the size of my task. This girl's lack of information was ternfying. Nor would it be enough merely to supply her with information. First she had to be taught to think.\n\nThis loomed as a project of no small dimensions, and at first | was tempted to",
