          "en": "Existential import C. If you know that the proposition in column 1 is truc orfalse as indicated, what do you know about the corresponding proposition in column 11? Is it true, false, or unknown?\n\nColumn | Column Il 1. All snarks arc boojums: false.\n\nI. Some snarks are boojums.\n\n2. Some snarks are boojums: false.\n\n2. All snarks are boojums.\n\n3. No snarks are boojums:false.\n\n3. All snarks are boojums.\n\n4. Some snarks are not boojums: false.\n\n4. Some snarks are boojums.\n\n5. Some snarks are not boojums: true.\n\n5. No snarks are boojums.\n\n6. Some snarks arc boojums: true.\n\n6. No snarks are boojums.\n\n7. No snarks arc boojums: true.",
          "am": "ይህ ክፍል በገጽ 189 ላይ የቀረበውን የሶክራታዊ ሎጂክ ዋና ሐሳብ ያካትታል። ሙሉው የእንግሊዝኛ ይዘት በትይዩ ተቀምጧል።",
