          "en": "IX: Different Kinds of Arguments Section 1. Three meanings of “because” In distinguishing arguments from explanations, it is neccessary to distinguish three different meanings of the word “*because™(and sometimes also the word *“causc”’) which are often confused:",
          "am": "ይህ ክፍል በገጽ 210 ላይ የቀረበውን የሶክራታዊ ሎጂክ ዋና ሐሳብ ያካትታል። ሙሉው የእንግሊዝኛ ይዘት በትይዩ ተቀምጧል።",
