          "en": "And a dilemma can do this.\n\nA dilemma is a syllogism with a disjunctive (“either-or”) premise and two hypothetical (“if-then™) premises.\n\none for each ofthe two alternatives of the disjunction. The disjunction scts up the two “homs™of the dilem- ma, and the hypothetical premis- cs follow the two “horns™to their conclusion.",
