          "speaker": "Page 350 (Continued)",
          "speakerAm": "ገጽ 350 (የቀጠለ)",
          "role": "prose",
          "en": "Yes. but surely you don’t believe there is such a thing as “the fem- inine mind.” Obviously there is a biological difference in our bodies, but “the feminine mind” is a social convention. In fact, “the feminine mind” 1s a fiction invented by the masculine mind!\n\nI think you may have a sclf-contradiction there .\n\n.\n\nI was only kidding, notliteral.\n\nTell me, Tiffany: do you agree with my disciple Plato that a human being is essentially a mind?\n\nOr with his disciple, Aristotle, that a human is essentially what psychologists call a psychosomatic unity, one substance with two dimensions. mate- nal and mental. rather than two substances?\n\nAnstotle, I think. He sounds much more commonsensical.\n\nAnd that “psychosomatic unity” — does it mean that any essential and innatc quality that pervades all of cither of these two dimen- sions must have some natural effect in the other?\n\nThat scems true.\n\nAnd arc masculinity and femininity essential and innate and all- pervasive qualities of the body? Or docs our biological gender come from social convention too, as “the feminine mind” docs?\n\nIt’s by nature. [ wouldn't call it “all-pervasive™though. That's sexism.\n\nI don't know what you mean by ‘sexism,but our identity as mas- culinc or feminine pervades cvery cell in our bodics, doesn’t it?\n\nYes.\n\nSo it scems to follow then that it must have some cffect on our other dimension, according to the principle of the psychosomat- ic unity that you believe.\n\nI gucss that follows.\n\nDoes it not also follow, then, that there is some truth to the old idea of a “feminine mind” and a “masculine mind\"?\n\nCongratulations.\n\nSocrates. So you agree with me in seeing that women are quite naturally and quite happily inferior.\n\nI did not saythat, Fatima. Nor do | believe it.\n\nBut you must see that that logically follows, Socrates. You are the father of logic, after all.\n\nYes. and you two arc thc mothers of the same unquestioned assumption from which both ofyour opposite conclusions follow.\n\nDon't you see it? You really should take a logic course some time, and pay close attention to cnthymemes!",
          "am": "የገጽ 350 ሁለተኛ ክፍል ውይይት እና ማብራሪያ።",
