          "en": "Howto read a book Socratically (4) Argument: What are its contents, its main terms, propositions, and argu- ments?\n\n(5) Evaluation: Is it true or not, and why? Use the pninciples you have learned in this book to summarize and then evaluate the book's argument.\n\n(6) Application: What of it? What follows? What difference does it make?",
          "am": "ይህ ክፍል በገጽ 367 ላይ የቀረበውን የሶክራታዊ ሎጂክ ዋና ሐሳብ ያካትታል። ሙሉው የእንግሊዝኛ ይዘት በትይዩ ተቀምጧል።",
